import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const f=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 631 | Time Domain and Law-First Axiom | Self-Consistency Verification of Time-Domain Settings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 631 | Time Domain and Law-First Axiom | Self-Consistency Verification of Time-Domain Settings","no":631,"module":3,"tags":["Law-First Axiom","Self-Consistency Verification","Time Domain","Setting","No-Retcon"],"related":["97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table","89-Time Paradox Prevention Mechanism","09-Reality-as-Basis Fundamental Standpoint"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0631_模块3-时间域法则优先-设定自洽性验证.md","filePath":"en/0631_模块3-时间域法则优先-设定自洽性验证.md"}'),a={name:"en/0631_模块3-时间域法则优先-设定自洽性验证.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-631-time-domain-and-law-first-axiom-self-consistency-verification-of-time-domain-settings" tabindex="-1">Entry 631 | Time Domain and Law-First Axiom | Self-Consistency Verification of Time-Domain Settings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-631-time-domain-and-law-first-axiom-self-consistency-verification-of-time-domain-settings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 631 | Time Domain and Law-First Axiom | Self-Consistency Verification of Time-Domain Settings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 89, 09 | Series: Time Domain and Law-First Axiom (Entry 1)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-such-complex-dual-track-settings-—-will-they-fight-themselves" tabindex="-1">Introduction: such complex dual-track settings — will they fight themselves <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-such-complex-dual-track-settings-—-will-they-fight-themselves" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: such complex dual-track settings — will they fight themselves&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-first axiom requires &quot;laws first, never retcon, setting self-consistency above plot convenience.&quot; The dual-track time domain is Module Three&#39;s most complex engineering — hundredfold flow, causal filtering, Alaya feedback, fault rollback... the more links, the easier settings contradict themselves. This entry does a &quot;self-consistency verification&quot;: check item by item whether the dual-track time domain&#39;s settings are internally consistent, conflict with the foundation, or hide &quot;retcon&quot; landmines. This is law-first axiom&#39;s direct landing in this module.</p><p>Among the six top-level axioms, law-first axiom is this entry&#39;s protagonist; the other four are the objects being verified: can anti-predation, republican of Myriad Races, collective ascension, causal self-discipline these four axioms simultaneously hold under dual-track settings without fighting? The sixth universal equal infinite law establishes the origin logic that all beings inherently possess basic infinite power and predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-verification-method-four-questions" tabindex="-1">I. Verification Method: Four Questions <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-verification-method-four-questions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Verification Method: Four Questions&quot;">​</a></h2><p>For each key setting of the dual-track time domain, test self-consistency with four questions:</p><ol><li><strong>Conflict with the foundation?</strong>: any contradiction with Documents 0–99&#39;s established laws?</li><li><strong>Does every link close?</strong>: can acceleration domain, Quest domain, switching, feedback, fault links close the loop?</li><li><strong>Are special cases covered?</strong>: do settings still hold under extreme cases (Myriad-Rank aliens, disaster faults)?</li><li><strong>Will it yield to plot?</strong>: did settings leave a backdoor for &quot;temporarily changed for wish-fulfilling plot&quot;?</li></ol><p>All four questions pass, then self-consistent.</p><h2 id="ii-self-consistency-check-of-key-settings" tabindex="-1">II. Self-Consistency Check of Key Settings <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-self-consistency-check-of-key-settings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Self-Consistency Check of Key Settings&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Key Setting</th><th>Self-Consistency Check</th><th>Conclusion</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hundredfold flow</td><td>Same origin as Document 16 Multiplication Fruit, not凭空 acceleration</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Causal-filter wall</td><td>Consistent with Document 87 &quot;only-knowledge-returned,&quot; does not disturb causality</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Time rollback</td><td>Consistent with Document 89 time-parox prevention &quot;rollback-able&quot;</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Incremental energy</td><td>Consistent with Document 15 energy cycle, does not draw stock</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank time conversion</td><td>Compatible with Document 50 Myriad-Race lineage, no omission</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr><tr><td>Dual-track division</td><td>Fast track R&amp;D, slow track sediment, consistent with Entry 501 overview</td><td>Self-consistent</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Item-by-item checked, the dual-track time domain&#39;s core settings all close under foundational laws, no fundamental conflict.</p><h2 id="iii-identifying-potential-retcon-landmines" tabindex="-1">III. Identifying Potential &quot;Retcon Landmines&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-identifying-potential-retcon-landmines" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Identifying Potential &quot;Retcon Landmines&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-consistency verification not only finds existing contradictions, but also identifies in advance &quot;plot-kidnapping&quot; landmines:</p><ul><li><strong>Landmine 1: protagonist-aura-style speed-up</strong>. If some character, by plot need, bypasses quota, cooling, ethical review — this is retcon. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s defense: no exception before law (Entries 619, 620).</li><li><strong>Landmine 2: acceleration used faster and faster</strong>. If for thrill, load lines (Entry 613) are constantly broken, the law network must collapse. Defense: load lines are physical ceilings; plot has no right to break through.</li><li><strong>Landmine 3: time-paradox beautification</strong>. If for thrill, causal forks are ignored, it repeats Douluo&#39;s crossing mistakes (Entry 604). Defense: causal reporting and rollback are non-exemptible.</li></ul><p>Marking these landmines in advance is law-first axiom&#39;s &quot;nip in the bud&quot; work.</p><h2 id="iv-self-consistency-is-civilization-s-engineering-confidence" tabindex="-1">IV. Self-Consistency Is Civilization&#39;s Engineering Confidence <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-self-consistency-is-civilization-s-engineering-confidence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Self-Consistency Is Civilization&#39;s Engineering Confidence&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The dual-track time domain dares open speed to 100×; one source of confidence is this self-consistency verification: <strong>settings hold on law, then dare let loose in engineering</strong>. This fundamentally contrasts with predatory-faction worlds&#39; &quot;enjoy first, retcon and abandon later&quot; — Shrouding&#39;s late-stage power inflation, Douluo&#39;s repeatedly crossed settings, are all costs of giving up self-consistency (Module Two analyzed in detail).</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s attitude: <strong>each setting expansion first passes self-consistency</strong>, rather slow than retcon.</p><h2 id="supplementary-argument-self-consistency-is-dual-responsibility-to-readers-and-the-future" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Argument: Self-Consistency Is Dual Responsibility to Readers and the Future <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-argument-self-consistency-is-dual-responsibility-to-readers-and-the-future" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Argument: Self-Consistency Is Dual Responsibility to Readers and the Future&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-first axiom requiring self-consistency is often treated as &quot;setting fetishism.&quot; Actually it is a kind of responsibility. A retcon-and-abandon worldview equals breaking faith with readers and later generations invested in it — today&#39;s setting changed for thrill, tomorrow makes countless people at a loss. The dual-track time domain insisting on item-by-item self-consistency checks, marking retcon landmines in advance, is responsible to the whole civilization and to future merged planes. Self-consistency does not bind imagination, but lets it go further: only when the laws underfoot do not collapse does civilization dare imagine an infinitely high future. Guarding self-consistency is guarding civilization&#39;s long dream from being woken by itself.</p><h2 id="brief-transition" tabindex="-1">Brief Transition <a class="header-anchor" href="#brief-transition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Brief Transition&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Specific to terminology: the Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s hundredfold flow, the Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s slow immersion, and the Alaya Network access protocol between them, the three mesh in self-consistency — any one altered by plot, the other two must be synchronously re-verified. Law-first axiom is therefore not empty words; it requires the Origin Acceleration Domain, Quest Sediment Domain, Alaya Network as a whole to be continuously checked.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: self-consistency verification clears landmines in advance, avoiding rework and collapse caused by setting contradictions</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: verification blocks the &quot;protagonist-aura speed-up&quot; backdoor; predatory privilege has no setting space</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo/Shrouding sacrifice self-consistency for plot; Heng Yuan Zhou constrains plot for self-consistency</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: verification covers five lineages&#39; special cases; no clan&#39;s settings omitted</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: self-consistency verification method public; any newly expanded settings self-check by the same standard</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The more complex the system, the more it needs self-consistency. The dual-track time domain uses &quot;four questions&quot; to verify item by item, confirming core settings close under foundational laws, and marking in advance landmines that may be plot-kidnapped. Law-first axiom here is not a slogan, but an engineering test each entry must pass. <strong>Settings self-consistent, civilization dares infinite expansion; where it cannot be self-consistent, better not write.</strong></p><p>In the end, the time-domain law-first · self-consistency verification described in this entry is no isolated case — it always points toward the shared-building direction of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">Entry 97 · Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/89-时间悖论防控机制.html">Entry 89 · Time Paradox Prevention Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/09-现实为基根本立场.html">Entry 09 · Reality-as-Basis Fundamental Standpoint</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">Entry 501 · Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{f as __pageData,m as default};
